    {"id":"file:src/App.tsx","type":"file","name":"App.tsx","filePath":"src/App.tsx","summary":"实现 Astryx 待办应用主界面，协调待办 CRUD、加载与错误状态、语言和主题切换，并通过 View Transitions API 动画化列表更新。","tags":["component","todo-ui","state-management","internationalization","view-transitions"],"complexity":"complex","languageNotes":"大型 React 函数组件将异步业务动作、派生状态与 Astryx 组件布局集中在同一文件中。"},
    {"id":"function:src/App.tsx:withListTransition","type":"function","name":"withListTransition","filePath":"src/App.tsx","lineRange":[39,51],"summary":"在浏览器支持且用户未要求减少动态效果时，用 View Transitions API 和 flushSync 包装列表状态更新，否则直接执行更新。","tags":["utility","animation","view-transitions"],"complexity":"simple"},
    {"id":"function:src/App.tsx:TodoRow","type":"function","name":"TodoRow","filePath":"src/App.tsx","lineRange":[53,110],"summary":"渲染单条待办的紧凑交互行，提供完成状态切换、忙碌态和删除操作，并使用本地化文案。","tags":["component","todo-item","event-handler","internationalization"],"complexity":"moderate"},
    {"id":"function:src/App.tsx:TodoApp","type":"function","name":"TodoApp","filePath":"src/App.tsx","lineRange":[112,321],"summary":"管理待办页面的全部状态和异步 CRUD 流程，组织语言、主题、测试数据和待办列表等 Astryx UI 区域。","tags":["component","state-management","api-client","todo-ui","event-handler"],"complexity":"complex"},
