    {"id":"file:src/api/client.ts","type":"file","name":"client.ts","filePath":"src/api/client.ts","summary":"封装前端 JSON API 客户端，根据桌面自定义协议或浏览器开发环境选择 API base，并暴露待办 CRUD 与原生窗口外观同步操作。","tags":["api-client","serialization","todo-service","window-chrome"],"complexity":"moderate","languageNotes":"使用泛型 request<T> 统一响应反序列化，并保持前端不依赖 @tauri-apps SDK。"},
