    {"id":"function:src/api/client.ts:request","type":"function","name":"request","filePath":"src/api/client.ts","lineRange":[25,46],"summary":"执行统一的 JSON fetch 请求，合并请求头、解析成功响应，并将后端错误转换为带状态码的 Error。","tags":["api-client","serialization","error-handling","utility"],"complexity":"moderate"},
    {"id":"function:src/api/client.ts:listTodos","type":"function","name":"listTodos","filePath":"src/api/client.ts","lineRange":[48,50],"summary":"请求并返回全部待办记录。","tags":["api-client","todo-service","query"],"complexity":"simple"},
